<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:wp81="using:Cornflower.Themes.Wp81">
  <!--
    The Windows Phone 8.1 FlipView, on Avalonia's Carousel: the SDK's generic.xaml default style for FlipView,
    re-expressed as an Avalonia ControlTheme. docs/controls/FlipView/PLAN.md has the values and their sources (#211's
    reads, tools/refapp/README.md, "Tier 4's reads").

    The phone's template is a Border, 2.5 in from each side, round a ScrollViewer round the items, and nothing else: no
    previous and next buttons, no indicator, no visual states. The Border is the phone's, bound to Background,
    BorderBrush and BorderThickness (Transparent and 0, the phone's setters). The ScrollViewer is not: the phone's
    snaps by item, and here PhoneFlipView's motion moves the items instead, laid out by PhoneFlipViewPanel, every item
    the size of the Border's inside, edge to edge. The Border clips them.

    FlipViewItem has no Avalonia type: the Carousel's container is a ContentPresenter, which, as the phone's
    FlipViewItem, draws nothing of its own and stretches its content over the whole item.

    The swipe, the snap and a change of one to SelectedIndex animating are PhoneFlipView's, on CornflowerClock.
    IsSwipeEnabled, Avalonia's, is on, as the phone's FlipView always swipes; set it off and the finger drags nothing.
    AutoScrollToSelectedItem is off: the selected item is laid out a page along before it slides in, and brought into
    view there it would scroll the page round the FlipView. A mouse drags nothing (touch and pen, as the Pivot's).
    A vertical FlipView is Avalonia's: a PageSlide with Orientation Vertical as PageTransition. The PageTransition never
    runs (its panel, Avalonia's VirtualizingCarouselPanel, is replaced); only its axis is read.

      <Carousel ItemsSource="{Binding Photos}" />
      <Carousel>
        <Carousel.PageTransition><PageSlide Orientation="Vertical" /></Carousel.PageTransition>
      </Carousel>
  -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type Carousel}" TargetType="Carousel">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="KeyboardNavigation.TabNavigation" Value="Once" />
    <Setter Property="IsTabStop" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="IsSwipeEnabled" Value="True" />
    <Setter Property="AutoScrollToSelectedItem" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="wp81:PhoneFlipView.IsEnabled" Value="True" />
    <Setter Property="ItemsPanel">
      <ItemsPanelTemplate>
        <wp81:PhoneFlipViewPanel />
      </ItemsPanelTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Border Margin="2.5"
                Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                ClipToBounds="True">
          <ItemsPresenter x:Name="PART_ItemsPresenter" ItemsPanel="{TemplateBinding ItemsPanel}" />
        </Border>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
  </ControlTheme>
</ResourceDictionary>
